# 🌐 16. Network Switch

A network switch connects devices on a LAN and forwards Ethernet frames primarily based on MAC addresses.

### Example

```text
PC1 ──┐
PC2 ──┼── Switch
PC3 ──┘
```

### OSI Layer

A traditional Ethernet switch primarily operates at:

**Layer 2 — Data Link**

### Interview Answer

> A network switch connects devices on a LAN and forwards Ethernet frames based primarily on MAC addresses.

