# 🧠 35. Professional Troubleshooting Methodology

The standard troubleshooting method developed throughout this roadmap is:

```text
1. Gather Information
        ↓
2. Clarify the Symptoms
        ↓
3. Identify Possible Causes
        ↓
4. Start With Basic Checks
        ↓
5. Collect Evidence
        ↓
6. Identify the Likely Root Cause
        ↓
7. Apply an Authorized Fix
        ↓
8. Verify With the User
        ↓
9. Document
        ↓
10. Close or Escalate
```

### Core Principle

> **Do not guess or make unnecessary changes. Investigate first, use evidence, make controlled changes, and verify the result.**

