> **Microsoft Teams is a collaboration platform used for chat, meetings, calls, and teamwork. In a Help Desk environment, I would troubleshoot Internet connectivity, authentication, MFA, licensing, service health, the web version, and finally the desktop application depending on the symptoms.**

This is the communication style I want to develop for technical interviews.

